Dear All

I just wrote patch for recent module, to add option --mask. Please dont 
hit me hard, since i am newbie for this stuff :)

Use case for this feature:
1)In some occasions i need to allow,block,match whole /24 subnet or 
other mask.
2)I can use recent as a trigger, e.g.:
iptables -I OUTPUT -p icmp -d 8.8.8.8/32 -m recent --name X --set 
--mask 0.0.0.0 -j ACCEPT
iptables -I OUTPUT -p icmp -d 2.2.2.10 -m recent --name X --rcheck 
--mask 0.0.0.0 -j REJECT

